Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Example: presets the TeamCraft server and locks the desktop app to it
; (docs/operations.md "Preconfigured server on managed computers").
; Replace the address. Import as administrator, or deploy with your tool of choice.
; The app reads HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE only, never HKEY_CURRENT_USER.
; "LockServer"=dword:00000000 (or deleting the value) presets without locking.

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SOFTWARE\Policies\Zeitgleich\TeamCraft]
"ServerUrl"="team.example.com"
"LockServer"=dword:00000001
